{"id":"accessdb.8","n":"accessdb","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"man-db","ver":"2.9.3-7.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/m/man-db-2.9.3-7.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/accessdb.8.gz","sha256":"48ef6c8ca37948db85bda26e62c714730a56de6325a11eb20f06f8cf75fe039d","date":"2020-06-22","origin":"2.9.3"},"u":{"pkg":"man-db","ver":"2.10.2-1","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/m/man-db/man-db_2.10.2-1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/accessdb.8.gz","sha256":"ef75d5dcea4aea5142e8b2b51b7c025836085cc8e58a154458434d2bd73635f4","date":"2022-03-17","origin":"2.10.2"}},"nopt":{"r":4,"u":4},"desc":"dumps the content of a man-db database in a human readable format","same":false,"r":[["NAME","<p>accessdb - dumps the content of a man-db database in a human readable format</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>/usr/sbin/accessdb</b> [<b>-d?V</b>] [<i>&lt;index-file&gt;</i>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>accessdb</b> will output the data contained within a man-db database in a human readable form. By default, it will dump the data from <b>/var/cache/man/index.&lt;db-type&gt;,</b> where &lt;db-type&gt; is dependent on the database library in use.</p> <p>Supplying an argument to accessdb will override this default.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-d</b>, <b>--debug</b></dt><dd>Print debugging information.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-?</b>, <b>--help</b></dt><dd>Print a help message and exit.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--usage</b></dt><dd>Print a short usage message and exit.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-V</b>, <b>--version</b></dt><dd>Display version information.</dd></dl>"],["AUTHOR","<pre>Wilf. (G.Wilford@ee.surrey.ac.uk).\nFabrizio Polacco (fpolacco@debian.org).\nColin Watson (cjwatson@debian.org).</pre>"],["BUGS","<p>https://savannah.nongnu.org/bugs/?group=man-db</p>"]],"u":[["NAME",0],["SYNOPSIS",1],["DESCRIPTION",2],["OPTIONS",3],["AUTHOR",4],["BUGS","<p>https://gitlab.com/cjwatson/man-db/-/issues <br> https://savannah.nongnu.org/bugs/?group=man-db</p>"]],"diff":{"r":[],"u":[]}}